usage: biological_viewers.py [-h]
                             {catalog,status,context,selected,prepare,verify,return} ...

Source-bound handoffs from Numi owners to OpenAI's native biological viewers.
This module prepares tool arguments, never runs a second renderer or
scientific engine. A prepared handoff is not a mounted viewer or an
observation reveal.

positional arguments:
  {catalog,status,context,selected,prepare,verify,return}
    catalog             Discover viewers and source/identity contracts
    status              Check actual companion plugin installations
    context             Inspect the current Wet Lab selection without reading
                        observations
    selected            Prepare an owner-authorized bounded cell page for
                        Slide Viewer
    prepare             Prepare an exact native-viewer opening; does not open
                        or reveal

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
exit_code=0
